// Generated Ukraine faction names and tooltips.

INI:FactionUkraine
"Ukraine"
END

SIDE:Ukraine
"Ukraine"
END

TOOLTIP:BioStrategyLong_Ukraine
"Find the approach, prepare an ambush, strike and relocate. Scouts expose targets for concealed anti-tank teams, prepared Buk salvos and attack drones. Fast artillery gives up shell power for mobility. Detectors, anti-air and close assaults break an unsupported ambush."
END

GUI:BioFeatures_Ukraine
"Prepared ambushes, reconnaissance, mobile artillery, disposable attack drones"
END

OBJECT:Ukraine_BTR4
"BTR-4"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_ConstructBTR4
"BTR-4"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_DescriptionBTR4
"Four-seat infantry carrier with an autocannon. Strong against infantry and light vehicles. Passengers must dismount to fire."
END

OBJECT:Ukraine_Buk
"Buk"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_ConstructBuk
"Buk"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_DescriptionBuk
"Prepared long-range air defence. Automatically sets up for 1.2 seconds, fires two heavy missiles, then reloads for 5.5 seconds. Packs for 0.7 seconds before moving. MANPADS cover its reload; cannot attack ground targets."
END

OBJECT:Ukraine_Bohdana
"Bohdana"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_ConstructBohdana
"Bohdana"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_DescriptionBohdana
"Fast, fragile wheeled artillery. A lighter, less accurate shell trades firepower for relocation. Sets up in 0.8 seconds and packs in 0.5 seconds; 80-unit minimum range. Fire and reposition."
END

OBJECT:Ukraine_DroneController
"Drone Controller"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_ConstructDroneController
"Drone Controller"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_DescriptionDroneController
"Fragile long-range attack-drone van. Automatically launches one drone every 12 seconds. Normal anti-air and missile defences can shoot the drone down. No stockpiling, anti-air attack or veterancy."
END

OBJECT:Ukraine_Rifleman
"Territorial Infantry"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_ConstructRifleman
"Territorial Infantry"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_DescriptionRifleman
"Affordable territorial infantry for screening and holding buildings. Can capture after Capture Training. Weak alone; anti-tank teams and BTRs supply support."
END

OBJECT:Ukraine_Stugna
"Stugna Team"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_ConstructStugna
"Stugna Team"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_DescriptionStugna
"Prepared ground anti-tank infantry with steady missile fire. Sets up for 1.2 seconds; packs in 0.5 seconds. Field Concealment hides a stationary team between engagements. Fragile against infantry and detection."
END

OBJECT:Ukraine_Commando
"Sapper"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_ConstructCommando
"Sapper"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_DescriptionCommando
"Sapper with a short-range carbine, detection and demolition charges. Deploys one mine at his feet for $100; mine arms after 3 seconds. No hero limit or innate stealth."
END

OBJECT:Ukraine_TB2
"TB2"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_ConstructTB2
"TB2"
END

CONTROLBAR:Ukraine_DescriptionTB2
"Persistent unarmed scout UAV. Stays airborne without returning to reload. Wide vision, fragile against air defence. Sensor Optics unlocks a short local detection sweep."
END

